<title>USA: HRE Properties Inc Q1 profit drops.</title>
<headline>HRE Properties Inc Q1 profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Jan 31.</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.86		    $1.31</p>
<p> Net			  4,364		    7,029</p>
<p> Revs			 8,556		    6,154</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,076		    5,367</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 period includes a gain of $6.25 million from the sale of properties.</p>
<p>Q1 funds from operations per share: $0.48 vs $0.43.</p>
